   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1. Which relationship creates which build edge",
   "originalText": "1. Which relationship creates which build edge",
   "fontSize": 30,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "el4_160816",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 26,
   "y": 214,
   "width": 1324.8,
   "height": 200.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1953574603,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1089709947,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1795463233560,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "UML arrow                   Example in Tomato                    Graph edge (build first → then)      Hard edge?\nInheritance    ───▷        DeliveryOrder ───▷ Order             Order → DeliveryOrder                always (base class must be complete)\nRealization    ┈┈┈▷        UpiPayment ┈┈┈▷ PaymentStrategy      PaymentStrategy → UpiPayment         always\nComposition    ◆───        Restaurant ◆─── MenuItem             MenuItem → Restaurant                always (stored by value, size needed)\n  (strong has-a / strict composition / part-of)\nAggregation    ◇───        RestaurantManager ◇─── Restaurant    Restaurant → RestaurantManager       only if the header calls its methods\n  (weak has-a)\nAssociation    ───>        Cart ───> Restaurant                 Restaurant → Cart                    only if the header calls its methods\n  (simple, knows-a)\nDependency     ┈┈┈>        NotificationService ┈┈┈> Order       Order → NotificationService          if it calls methods or does new X",
   "originalText": "UML arrow                   Example in Tomato                    Graph edge (build first → then)      Hard edge?\nInheritance    ───▷        DeliveryOrder ───▷ Order             Order → DeliveryOrder                always (base class must be complete)\nRealization    ┈┈┈▷        UpiPayment ┈┈┈▷ PaymentStrategy      PaymentStrategy → UpiPayment         always\nComposition    ◆───        Restaurant ◆─── MenuItem             MenuItem → Restaurant                always (stored by value, size needed)\n  (strong has-a / strict composition / part-of)\nAggregation    ◇───        RestaurantManager ◇─── Restaurant    Restaurant → RestaurantManager       only if the header calls its methods\n  (weak has-a)\nAssociation    ───>        Cart ───> Restaurant                 Restaurant → Cart                    only if the header calls its methods\n  (simple, knows-a)\nDependency     ┈┈┈>        NotificationService ┈┈┈> Order       Order → NotificationService          if it calls methods or does new X",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "el5_325127",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 26,
   "y": 438.0,
   "width": 1326.0,
   "height": 21.25,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#c92a2a",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 80521325,
