   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "6. Algorithm A: Kahn (BFS, indegree)",
   "originalText": "6. Algorithm A: Kahn (BFS, indegree)",
   "fontSize": 30,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "el131_309001",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 26,
   "y": 2538.25,
   "width": 576.0,
   "height": 300.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1026567497,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1909136608,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1795463233560,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "KAHN'S ALGORITHM (BFS)  \"start from the basic units\"\n\n1. One node per class box in the UML\n2. For every UML arrow add an edge  prerequisite → dependent\n   (use the reversal rules: arrowhead end / part end first)\n3. indeg[X] = number of edges coming into X\n4. queue ← every class with indeg 0\n5. while queue is not empty:\n       X ← queue.pop_front()\n       write X.h, compile, test it from main.cpp\n       for each D that depends on X:\n           indeg[D] -= 1\n           if indeg[D] == 0: queue.push_back(D)\n6. if written < total classes:\n       a cycle exists → break it (see Cycles), rerun",
   "originalText": "KAHN'S ALGORITHM (BFS)  \"start from the basic units\"\n\n1. One node per class box in the UML\n2. For every UML arrow add an edge  prerequisite → dependent\n   (use the reversal rules: arrowhead end / part end first)\n3. indeg[X] = number of edges coming into X\n4. queue ← every class with indeg 0\n5. while queue is not empty:\n       X ← queue.pop_front()\n       write X.h, compile, test it from main.cpp\n       for each D that depends on X:\n           indeg[D] -= 1\n           if indeg[D] == 0: queue.push_back(D)\n6. if written < total classes:\n       a cycle exists → break it (see Cycles), rerun",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
