   "text": "7. Algorithm B: DFS (post-order)",
   "originalText": "7. Algorithm B: DFS (post-order)",
   "fontSize": 30,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "el134_939724",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1002.6666666666666,
   "y": 2538.25,
   "width": 470.4,
   "height": 380.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 2031874606,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 2086618137,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1795463233560,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "DFS  \"start from main, keep asking what it needs\"\n\nvisit(X):\n    if state[X] == DONE:     return\n    if state[X] == VISITING: CYCLE FOUND\n    state[X] = VISITING\n    for each P that X needs:      # its #includes\n        visit(P)\n    state[X] = DONE\n    order.append(X)               # post-order\n\nvisit(main); then visit any class not reached\n\norder = leaves first, main last.\nKahn gives 'waves' (all basic units together);\nDFS is how you think top-down: to write TomatoApp\nI need the managers, to write OrderManager I need\nOrder, to write Order I need User ...\nBoth give a valid order. The order is not unique.",
   "originalText": "DFS  \"start from main, keep asking what it needs\"\n\nvisit(X):\n    if state[X] == DONE:     return\n    if state[X] == VISITING: CYCLE FOUND\n    state[X] = VISITING\n    for each P that X needs:      # its #includes\n        visit(P)\n    state[X] = DONE\n    order.append(X)               # post-order\n\nvisit(main); then visit any class not reached\n\norder = leaves first, main last.\nKahn gives 'waves' (all basic units together);\nDFS is how you think top-down: to write TomatoApp\nI need the managers, to write OrderManager I need\nOrder, to write Order I need User ...\nBoth give a valid order. The order is not unique.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
