   "text": "9. Kahn's algorithm run on Tomato, step by step",
   "originalText": "9. Kahn's algorithm run on Tomato, step by step",
   "fontSize": 30,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "el140_587958",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 26,
   "y": 3058.25,
   "width": 1467.0,
   "height": 562.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1731949819,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1408444750,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1795463233560,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Step  Write this (pop)        Indegree drops                              Became 0 → enqueue                Queue after\n  1   MenuItem                Restaurant 1→0, Cart 2→1, Order 4→3         Restaurant                        PaymentStrategy, TimeUtils, Restaurant\n  2   PaymentStrategy         UpiPayment 1→0, CreditCardPayment 1→0,      UpiPayment, CreditCardPayment,    TimeUtils, Restaurant, UpiPayment, CreditCardPayment,\n                              NetBankingPayment 1→0, Order 3→2            NetBankingPayment                 NetBankingPayment\n  3   TimeUtils               ScheduledOrderFactory 4→3                   -                                 Restaurant, UpiPayment, CreditCardPayment,\n                                                                                                            NetBankingPayment\n  4   Restaurant              Cart 1→0, RestaurantManager 1→0, Order 2→1  Cart, RestaurantManager           UpiPayment, CreditCardPayment, NetBankingPayment, Cart,\n                                                                                                            RestaurantManager\n  5   UpiPayment              main 2→1                                    -                                 CreditCardPayment, NetBankingPayment, Cart,\n                                                                                                            RestaurantManager\n  6   CreditCardPayment       -                                           -                                 NetBankingPayment, Cart, RestaurantManager\n  7   NetBankingPayment       -                                           -                                 Cart, RestaurantManager\n  8   Cart                    User 1→0                                    User                              RestaurantManager, User\n  9   RestaurantManager       TomatoApp 6→5                               -                                 User\n 10   User                    Order 1→0, TomatoApp 5→4                    Order                             Order\n 11   Order                   DeliveryOrder 1→0, PickupOrder 1→0,         DeliveryOrder, PickupOrder,       DeliveryOrder, PickupOrder, NotificationService,\n                              NotificationService 1→0, OrderManager 1→0,  NotificationService,              OrderManager, OrderFactory\n                              OrderFactory 1→0                            OrderManager, OrderFactory\n 12   DeliveryOrder           NowOrderFactory 3→2,                        -                                 PickupOrder, NotificationService, OrderManager,\n                              ScheduledOrderFactory 3→2                                                     OrderFactory\n 13   PickupOrder             NowOrderFactory 2→1,                        -                                 NotificationService, OrderManager, OrderFactory\n                              ScheduledOrderFactory 2→1\n 14   NotificationService     TomatoApp 4→3                               -                                 OrderManager, OrderFactory\n 15   OrderManager            TomatoApp 3→2                               -                                 OrderFactory\n 16   OrderFactory            NowOrderFactory 1→0,                        NowOrderFactory,                  NowOrderFactory, ScheduledOrderFactory\n                              ScheduledOrderFactory 1→0                   ScheduledOrderFactory\n 17   NowOrderFactory         TomatoApp 2→1                               -                                 ScheduledOrderFactory\n 18   ScheduledOrderFactory   TomatoApp 1→0                               TomatoApp                         TomatoApp\n 19   TomatoApp               main 1→0                                    main                              main\n 20   main                    -                                           -                                 [ ]",
   "originalText": "Step  Write this (pop)        Indegree drops                              Became 0 → enqueue                Queue after\n  1   MenuItem                Restaurant 1→0, Cart 2→1, Order 4→3         Restaurant                        PaymentStrategy, TimeUtils, Restaurant\n  2   PaymentStrategy         UpiPayment 1→0, CreditCardPayment 1→0,      UpiPayment, CreditCardPayment,    TimeUtils, Restaurant, UpiPayment, CreditCardPayment,\n                              NetBankingPayment 1→0, Order 3→2            NetBankingPayment                 NetBankingPayment\n  3   TimeUtils               ScheduledOrderFactory 4→3                   -                                 Restaurant, UpiPayment, CreditCardPayment,\n                                                                                                            NetBankingPayment\n  4   Restaurant              Cart 1→0, RestaurantManager 1→0, Order 2→1  Cart, RestaurantManager           UpiPayment, CreditCardPayment, NetBankingPayment, Cart,\n                                                                                                            RestaurantManager\n  5   UpiPayment              main 2→1                                    -                                 CreditCardPayment, NetBankingPayment, Cart,\n                                                                                                            RestaurantManager\n  6   CreditCardPayment       -                                           -                                 NetBankingPayment, Cart, RestaurantManager\n  7   NetBankingPayment       -                                           -                                 Cart, RestaurantManager\n  8   Cart                    User 1→0                                    User                              RestaurantManager, User\n  9   RestaurantManager       TomatoApp 6→5                               -                                 User\n 10   User                    Order 1→0, TomatoApp 5→4                    Order                             Order\n 11   Order                   DeliveryOrder 1→0, PickupOrder 1→0,         DeliveryOrder, PickupOrder,       DeliveryOrder, PickupOrder, NotificationService,\n                              NotificationService 1→0, OrderManager 1→0,  NotificationService,              OrderManager, OrderFactory\n                              OrderFactory 1→0                            OrderManager, OrderFactory\n 12   DeliveryOrder           NowOrderFactory 3→2,                        -                                 PickupOrder, NotificationService, OrderManager,\n                              ScheduledOrderFactory 3→2                                                     OrderFactory\n 13   PickupOrder             NowOrderFactory 2→1,                        -                                 NotificationService, OrderManager, OrderFactory\n                              ScheduledOrderFactory 2→1\n 14   NotificationService     TomatoApp 4→3                               -                                 OrderManager, OrderFactory\n 15   OrderManager            TomatoApp 3→2                               -                                 OrderFactory\n 16   OrderFactory            NowOrderFactory 1→0,                        NowOrderFactory,                  NowOrderFactory, ScheduledOrderFactory\n                              ScheduledOrderFactory 1→0                   ScheduledOrderFactory\n 17   NowOrderFactory         TomatoApp 2→1                               -                                 ScheduledOrderFactory\n 18   ScheduledOrderFactory   TomatoApp 1→0                               TomatoApp                         TomatoApp\n 19   TomatoApp               main 1→0                                    main                              main\n 20   main                    -                                           -                                 [ ]",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "el141_253274",
