   "text": "11. Layer rules + the generic hierarchy",
   "originalText": "11. Layer rules + the generic hierarchy",
   "fontSize": 30,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "el192_774714",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1356,
   "y": 3800.75,
   "width": 645.84,
   "height": 292.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1417890072,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 786372626,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1795463233560,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "• A file may #include only from its own layer or a lower one\n• Never include upward (a model must never include a manager)\n• Inside a layer, follow the topological order\n• Folders group by ROLE, layers decide BUILD ORDER:\n  Order lives in models/ but needs strategies/PaymentStrategy.h,\n  so PaymentStrategy is written before Order\n• Memory hooks:\n  interface before implementation   (PaymentStrategy → UpiPayment)\n  part before whole                 (MenuItem → Restaurant)\n  parent before child               (Order → DeliveryOrder)\n  product before its factory        (DeliveryOrder → NowOrderFactory)\n  item before its manager           (Order → OrderManager)\n  everything before the facade, facade before main",
   "originalText": "• A file may #include only from its own layer or a lower one\n• Never include upward (a model must never include a manager)\n• Inside a layer, follow the topological order\n• Folders group by ROLE, layers decide BUILD ORDER:\n  Order lives in models/ but needs strategies/PaymentStrategy.h,\n  so PaymentStrategy is written before Order\n• Memory hooks:\n  interface before implementation   (PaymentStrategy → UpiPayment)\n  part before whole                 (MenuItem → Restaurant)\n  parent before child               (Order → DeliveryOrder)\n  product before its factory        (DeliveryOrder → NowOrderFactory)\n  item before its manager           (Order → OrderManager)\n  everything before the facade, facade before main",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "el193_249924",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1356,
   "y": 4123.25,
   "width": 508.79999999999995,
   "height": 260.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 543544937,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1895869074,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1795463233560,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Generic LLD hierarchy (works for any problem:\nparking lot, BookMyShow, Splitwise, elevator ...)\n\n 9  main / client\n 8  facade / controller / orchestrator\n 7  managers / repositories (singletons)\n 6  factories\n 5  services (notification, pricing, matching)\n 4  concrete implementations (strategies, subclasses)\n 3  abstract bases + interfaces that need models\n 2  composite models (hold other models)\n 1  leaf models (only primitives / std types)\n 0  utils, enums, constants, pure interfaces",
   "originalText": "Generic LLD hierarchy (works for any problem:\nparking lot, BookMyShow, Splitwise, elevator ...)\n\n 9  main / client\n 8  facade / controller / orchestrator\n 7  managers / repositories (singletons)\n 6  factories\n 5  services (notification, pricing, matching)\n 4  concrete implementations (strategies, subclasses)\n 3  abstract bases + interfaces that need models\n 2  composite models (hold other models)\n 1  leaf models (only primitives / std types)\n 0  utils, enums, constants, pure interfaces",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "el194_243921",
